    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlahīla kūbaleka bake babo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ezila aho alīlomba na kūtambūūla, kūnū akūlīlaga na kwiponanja hasī ū kū būtongi bo numba ya ng'wa Mulungu, ibità itaale lya Baisilaeli līkibilinga aho walī, bagosha na bakīma na baana; nabo būyūlīla mu kūsaatwa kūtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla Shekania ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehieli, ūmò wa banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Elamu ūng'wīla ū Ezila, “Twang'hūbile ū Mulungu wise kūlwa nguno twatoolile bakīma ba kūfuma mu mahanga ga banhū ba mu sī īyī; alīyo nahene kūtaalī kūlīho ū kwisagīlwa ū kū Baisilaeli, nūūlū īkī yajile gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, tūtūūlagi ilagane a ha gatī yise nū Mulungu wise, tūbaleke a bakīma benaba pye a bose, na a baana babo, gīt'ūmo ūlītūganikīla baba; ūmo bahayīlile na a bangī abo baalī na logohano kū shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu wise, nīyo ī lilagane lyenīlo lītūūlwe gīt'ūmo shihayīlile ī shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būkaga baba, ū mhayo gwenūyū gūlī mu nkono gwako; gwītage, na a bise tūlī hamò nang'ho kūkūguzuhya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ezila ūbūka, ūbilahīja a bagabīji a batongeeji na a Balawī, na a Baisileli a bose, gīkī bakwīta īyo yahayiagwa; nabo ng'hana bilahīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho lūūlū ū Ezila hū wīnga ū kū būtongi bo numba ya ng'wa Mulungu, ūja mu chumba sha ng'wa Yohanani, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Eliyashibu ūūkakeyula ng'wenūmo, atalile nūūlū kūng'wa yaya; nguno walī ataalī ūlīla kūlwa nguno ya banhū abo baalī bafuma kū būsaamiwa, abo bakalemeelwa ū kūbiza bishigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna gūhelwa gwa kwibilinga pye a banhū abo baalī bashoka kūfuma kū būsaamiwa, hūna būkumūkījiwa hose pyī ū mu Būyudaya nī Yelusalemu, gīkī bize kwibilingīla Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shūtūūlwa shilagīlo gīkī ose ose ūyo alaleke kūshika aho shikū idatū jitaalī kūshila, a basugi na a banamhala badūgije kūlagīla ataajiwe pyī ī shikolo shakwe, hama ū wei ng'wenekīlī asūngūlwe ū ng'wibità lya bashoki ba kūfuma kū būsaamiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Libilinga lya Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana pye a bagosha ba mu Būyudaya nī Benjamini bibilinga ī Yelusalemu aho jitaalī ū kūshila ī shikū īj'idatū. Lwalī lūshikū lwa makūmi abīlī ng'weji gwa kenda; a ha būtongi bo numba ya ng'wa Mulungu lyalīho ibbaala igalī, pye a banhū bigasha henaho hasī, bakūdetemaga kūlwa nguno yago ū mhayo gwenūyo, na kūlwa nguno yatūlaga mbula nhaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ngabīji Ezila wīmīīla ūbawīla, “Ng'wahūbile nguno ng'watoolile bakīma ba kūfuma mu mahanga, ng'ūbongeleleja ū būbi wa Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī haha ntambūūlīlagi ū SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we, ng'wīte īyo ayīhayile. Mulekane nabo a banhū abo mukwikalaga hamò nabo, na a bake bing'we a ba kūfuma mu banhū ba mahanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū būhaya n'ilaka lya higūlya, “H'ūmo īlī; shitwigelile twīte gīt'ūmo ūlīhayīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha balī bingī no a banhū, hama nīyo īlītūla na mbula; tūtūdūla ū kwikala twīmīīlaga hanze aha. Na hangī nīyo ū nīmo gwenūyū gūtī gwa kwītwa lūshikū lūmò dūhū nūūlū ibīlī, nguno twahūbile no ū mu mhayo gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeeji bise ni bīmīīla a ha ng'wanya gw'ibità lya banhū. Hūna pye abo balī mu mizengo yise abo batoolile bakīma ba kūfuma mu mahanga, bahelelwe makanza gigelile, bayiza hamò na a balamuji na a banamhala ba mu mizengo, kūshisha būtwīngīle ū būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu wise ū mu mhayo gwenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Asaheli, na Yahizeya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Tikiva; a babīlī benabo būlema ū kwizunīlīja nago ū mhayo gwenūyū, būgunījiwa na Balawī ba Meshulamu na Shabetai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a banhū abo baalī bashoka kūfuma kū būsaamiwa bīīta gīt'ūmo gūkahelelwa. Ū Ezila ū ngabīji ūsolanhya banhū, abo baalī bataale ba kaya ja bakūlūgenji babo, munhū ūmò būlī kaya ya bakūlūgenji, pye a bose bandīkwa a mina gabo. Mu lūshikū lwa kwandya mu ng'weji gw'ikūmi bigasha kūgūlola ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lwashika lūshikū lwa kwandya mu ng'weji gwa kwandya, būmala ū kwīlola ī mihayo ya bagosha abo baalī batoola bakīma ba kūfuma mu banhū ba mahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abo bakabonwa būhūbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ba shibyalīlwe sha bagabīji, a banhū aba hū baalī batoola bakīma ba mahanga gangī: A ba kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Yeshua ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosadaki na baana ba ng'wawe baalī, Maaseya, Eliezeli, Yalibu na Gadalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(A benaba bakazunya ū kūlekana na a bake babo, ī shakwinha shabo ī sha kūfunya kūlwa kwihīga yūbiza ng'ondi ya ng'holo kūfuma ng'widaale.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Imeeli baalī, Hanaani na Zebadia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Halimu baalī, Maaseya, Eliya, Shemaya, Yehieli, na Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Pashuli baalī, Elioenai, Maaseya, Ishimaeli, Nesaneli, Yozabadi, na Elasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha Balawī baalī, Yozabadi, Shimei, Kelaiya (hū kūhaya Kelita), Petahiya, Yuda na Eliezeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma mu bīmbi, Eliashibu. A ba kūfuma mu balang'hani ba ha milyango baalī, Shalumu, Telemu, na Uli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bene ba kūfuma mu Baisilaeli a bangī. Ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Paloshi baalīho ba, Lamia, Izia, Malikīya, Miyamini, Eleazali, Malikīya, na Benaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
